			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Fixed empty `particle` texture in all fluid block models (apple cider, beef stew, beetroot soup, chicken soup, fish stew, hot cocoa, melon juice, mushroom stew, noodle soup, pumpkin soup, rabbit stew, tomato sauce, vegetable soup) — caused `StringIndexOutOfBoundsException: Failed to load model` log spam on resource reload. Fixes #11.\n- Farmer's Delight Refabricated support updates\n- Mexican Spanish translation\n- Build workflow updated to Java 21 / Ubuntu 24.04 (CI)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Flomik10002/DelightfulCreatorsFabric/compare/v1.3...v1.6-1.20.x"
